TAVONEL Cloud Run PDF-Raster CDR — third-party notices
======================================================

Scope: the container built by `quarantine-sidecar/cdr-cloudrun/Dockerfile` and the ClamAV
sidecar pinned in `service.yaml`. TAVONEL's own source in this directory is proprietary and
is not covered by any licence below.

Every Python row is the licence string in the *installed* distribution's own metadata
(`importlib.metadata`: `License-Expression`, else `License`, else the OSI classifier),
read on 2026-09-08 from the pinned versions in `requirements.txt`. Nothing here is inferred
from a project's website or from memory.


