Known limits of this NOTICE
---------------------------

- Only the six direct dependencies are pinned. Their transitive dependencies (starlette,
  pydantic, anyio, h11, click, httptools, uvloop, websockets, watchfiles, python-dotenv,
  PyYAML, certifi, idna, typing-extensions, …) are resolved at `pip install` time and are
  **not** pinned, so two builds of the same Dockerfile can differ. Their licences are not
  enumerated here.
- Debian package licences above are the upstream project licences, not a per-file audit of
  `/usr/share/doc/*/copyright` in the built image.
- No SBOM has been generated from a built image. A machine-readable SBOM (CycloneDX/SPDX) of
  the exact deployed digest is still outstanding and is required by §29.1 before release.
